{'symbol': 'GPC', 'date': '2022-08-15 16:30:00', 'title': 'GENUINE PARTS COMPANY DECLARES REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': "ATLANTA , AUG. 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- GENUINE PARTS COMPANY (NYSE: GPC) ANNOUNCED TODAY ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF EIGHTY-NINE AND ONE-HALF CENTS ($0.895) PER SHARE ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE OCTOBER 3, 2022 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD SEPTEMBER 2, 2022."}